# Claude Code runtime state — never commit
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/jobs/
.claude/imps/learnings.md

# Per-machine permission grants. This one is load-bearing, not tidiness: the
# opencode harness needs a Bash rule that runs *outside* Claude Code's sandbox
# (plugins/imps/references/opencode-harness.md), and a committed sandbox-off
# grant in a public marketplace repo would be inherited by every contributor and
# agent session that clones it. Previously ignored only by a machine-local
# ~/.gitignore_global, i.e. by nothing at all on any other clone.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Goldfish judge run artifacts (transient scratch from /elephant-goldfish:elephant)
.goldfish-runs/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Session scratch spine (written by plan mode / CLAUDE.md workflow, not a repo artifact)
GOAL.md
